### Bộ request cho IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client (biến lưu giữa các request bằng client.global).
@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@keyboard = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@mouse = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@laptop = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### 1. Đăng ký (đổi email mỗi lần chạy)
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "alice-{{$random.uuid}}@example.com", "password": "alice-password-1", "fullName": "Alice"}

> {% client.global.set("email", response.body.email); %}

### 2. Đăng nhập
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{email}}", "password": "alice-password-1"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 3. Ví (có thể 404 WALLET_NOT_INITIALIZED trong ~1 giây đầu)
GET {{gateway}}/api/wallet/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Sản phẩm (public)
GET {{gateway}}/api/products

### 5. Tồn kho (public)
GET {{gateway}}/api/inventory/{{keyboard}}

### 6. Thêm vào giỏ
POST {{gateway}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": "{{keyboard}}", "quantity": 2}

### 7. Thêm chuột
POST {{gateway}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": "{{mouse}}", "quantity": 1}

### 8. Xem giỏ
GET {{gateway}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Checkout (gửi lại request này với cùng key → cùng orderId, HTTP 200)
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: checkout-demo-{{email}}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.orderId); %}

### 10. Poll trạng thái đơn
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Lịch sử ledger
GET {{gateway}}/api/wallet/me/ledger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Checkout không token → 401
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/checkout
Idempotency-Key: anonymous-attempt-1

### ---------------- ADMIN ----------------
### 13. Đăng nhập admin (ADMIN_EMAIL / ADMIN_PASSWORD trong .env)
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@webshop.local", "password": "local-only-admin-pw"}

> {% client.global.set("admin", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 14. Đặt tồn kho
PUT {{gateway}}/api/inventory/{{mouse}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"stockOnHand": 200}

### 15. Chi tiết Saga (gọi thẳng order-service)
GET http://localhost:8086/admin/sagas/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 16. DLQ của payment-service
GET http://localhost:8085/admin/dlq
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
